# No `.claude/worktrees` entry, unlike the other tools' ignore files.
# Inside a linked worktree, oxlint resolves a relative --ignore-path
# against the main checkout's copy of this file, and patterns resolve
# from that file's directory, so `**/.claude/worktrees/**` matched every
# file in the worktree and oxlint linted nothing. The root .gitignore
# already keeps nested worktrees out of a main-checkout run.

# Terraform state and generated files
**/.terraform/**

# Build artifacts and tooling caches
**/*.min.js
**/.conformetry
**/.nx
**/.venv
**/build
**/coverage
**/dist
**/node_modules
**/tmp
**/vite.config.*.timestamp*
**/vitest.config.*.timestamp*

# Lock files and changelog
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
CHANGELOG.md

# Generated files
**/routeTree.gen.ts
applications/lexico/src/routeTree.gen.ts
.claude/CLAUDE.md
.github/copilot-instructions.md
lint-staged.config.ts
**/packages/lexico-components/src/components/**
**/packages/lexico-components/src/hooks/**
**/packages/lexico-components/src/lib/**

# Templates and data
**/helm/**/templates/**
**/src/modules/*/templates/**
**/applications/lexico-ingestion/data/**
**/applications/lexico-ingestion/src/modules/literature/literature.constants.ts
**/applications/lexico-ingestion/src/modules/library/library.constants.ts
**/library.json

# Vendored skill content (framework-managed, not codebase-authored source)
**/.agents/skills/**
**/.claude/skills/**
**/.github/skills/**
**/documentation/skills/**
